{"4534960":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Dear Passengers","steam_appid":4534960,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLD’S WORST AIRLINE IS HIRING!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends are the crew. Your job is to deliver passengers and cargo to their destination. Preferably in one piece. While one of you pilots the plane, the others keep the cabin together, serve the passengers, and deal with whatever goes wrong before it gets much worse. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/72d76f477a9ffe60247add086058229c.poster.avif?t=1787132605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/72d76f477a9ffe60247add086058229c.webm?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/72d76f477a9ffe60247add086058229c.mp4?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO BUDGET PREMIUM!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passengers expect food, drinks, and a smooth flight. Try to provide at least two of those.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/b38be1c8eadab48b4f006d0b954b18ee.poster.avif?t=1787132605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/b38be1c8eadab48b4f006d0b954b18ee.webm?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/b38be1c8eadab48b4f006d0b954b18ee.mp4?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORE TROUBLE, MORE MONEY!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before takeoff, choose which passengers and cargo to bring onboard. The bigger the payout, the more trouble it usually causes. Some cargo is hard to handle, some passengers are hard to please, and some flights start going wrong before you even leave the ground.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/25ceff13ea6240cf267be999c61fb47b.poster.avif?t=1787132605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/25ceff13ea6240cf267be999c61fb47b.webm?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/25ceff13ea6240cf267be999c61fb47b.mp4?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAFETY IS OUR TOP-3 PRIORITY!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trouble can start anywhere onboard. Keep the passengers under control, protect the cargo, and do whatever it takes to stop one problem from turning into a full-blown disaster. Not every solution is elegant, and not every passenger stays onboard.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/be3f18a26a23c1a852bcf50250272691.poster.avif?t=1787132605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/be3f18a26a23c1a852bcf50250272691.webm?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/be3f18a26a23c1a852bcf50250272691.mp4?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROUGH AIR AHEAD!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather can turn a normal flight into a disaster. Turbulence and air pockets throw passengers, luggage, and anything else that is loose around the cabin. One bad turn can send the whole plane into chaos.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/20015678aa61bb85bc94405062b84228.poster.avif?t=1787132605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/20015678aa61bb85bc94405062b84228.webm?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/20015678aa61bb85bc94405062b84228.mp4?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op with friends<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot the plane or work inside the cabin<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based passengers, cargo, and cabin chaos<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather, turbulence, and air pockets<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risky passengers and high-paying cargo<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLD’S WORST AIRLINE IS HIRING!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends are the crew. Your job is to deliver passengers and cargo to their destination. Preferably in one piece. While one of you pilots the plane, the others keep the cabin together, serve the passengers, and deal with whatever goes wrong before it gets much worse. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/72d76f477a9ffe60247add086058229c.poster.avif?t=1787132605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/72d76f477a9ffe60247add086058229c.webm?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/72d76f477a9ffe60247add086058229c.mp4?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO BUDGET PREMIUM!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passengers expect food, drinks, and a smooth flight. Try to provide at least two of those.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/b38be1c8eadab48b4f006d0b954b18ee.poster.avif?t=1787132605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/b38be1c8eadab48b4f006d0b954b18ee.webm?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/b38be1c8eadab48b4f006d0b954b18ee.mp4?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORE TROUBLE, MORE MONEY!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before takeoff, choose which passengers and cargo to bring onboard. The bigger the payout, the more trouble it usually causes. Some cargo is hard to handle, some passengers are hard to please, and some flights start going wrong before you even leave the ground.<