to chaos.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/20015678aa61bb85bc94405062b84228.poster.avif?t=1787132605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/20015678aa61bb85bc94405062b84228.webm?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/extras\/20015678aa61bb85bc94405062b84228.mp4?t=1787132605\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op with friends<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot the plane or work inside the cabin<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based passengers, cargo, and cabin chaos<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather, turbulence, and air pockets<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risky passengers and high-paying cargo<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Play in co-op as the crew of the world’s worst airline. Your plane is falling apart, your cargo is illegal, and passenger safety barely makes the list.","supported_languages":"английский, арабский, китайский (упр.), турецкий, украинский, японский","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/7ddef53346afe3e3d4d479dbed740cdb38cfe09a\/header.jpg?t=1787132605","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/d7b0a9376fb4cab61548730f3e98d3ba1935bc9d\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787132605","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4534960\/d7b0a9376fb4cab61548730f3e98d3ba1935bc9d\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787132